    terms: [["Marriage", "A covenant union of a man and a woman before God, meant to be lifelong."], ["Helper", "A partner who corresponds to and strengthens the other; the Hebrew word is also used of God."], ["One flesh", "The deep union of husband and wife in body, mind and life."]],
    intro: "Then the Lord God said, It is not good that the man should be alone; I will make him a helper fit for him. After bringing the animals to the man, none was found to be his partner. So God made the woman and brought her to the man, who said, This at last is bone of my bones and flesh of my flesh. Therefore a man shall leave his father and his mother and hold fast to his wife, and they shall become one flesh. Marriage begins here, in the garden, by God's design.",
