    observe: "Genesis 2:18 says it is not good that the man should be alone. The word helper does not mean inferior; it is used of God as our help. Verse 23 records the man's joyful poetry at meeting the woman. Verse 24 gives the pattern: leaving, holding fast and becoming one flesh. Verse 25 says that they were both naked and were not ashamed, which pictures openness and trust. Genesis 1:28 adds the mandate to be fruitful and to care for the earth together.",
